- (void)mouseDragged:(NSEvent*)event{if(self.shopMode)return;[self.tooltip hide];[self.hoverView hide];[self.effectsLayer hideSlot:nil];self.hoverSlot=nil;self.needsDisplay=YES;[self.dragController drag:event];}
- (void)mouseDown:(NSEvent*)event{if(self.shopMode)return;[self.dragController begin:event inView:self];[self.tooltip hide];[self.hoverView hide];[self.effectsLayer hideSlot:nil];self.hoverSlot=nil;self.needsDisplay=YES;}
- (void)mouseUp:(NSEvent*)event{if(!self.shopMode&&[self.dragController finish:event])return;NSPoint p=[self convertPoint:event.locationInWindow fromView:nil];p.x*=190/self.bounds.size.width;p.y*=429/self.bounds.size.height;if((NSPointInRect(p,NSMakeRect(169,7,13,12))||(self.shopMode&&NSPointInRect(p,NSMakeRect(13,391,36,29))))&&self.closeHandler){self.closeHandler();return;}if(self.shopMode&&self.repairAllowed&&!self.buying){if(NSPointInRect(p,NSMakeRect(54,390,36,29))){self.repairMode=!self.repairMode;if(self.repairModeHandler)self.repairModeHandler(self.repairMode);return;}if(NSPointInRect(p,NSMakeRect(98,390,36,29))){if(self.repairAllHandler)self.repairAllHandler();return;}}if(self.repairMode)return;if(self.shopMode&&!self.buying&&self.buyHandler&&slots){for(auto& pair:*slots){auto& item=catalog->at(pair.second.index);if(NSPointInRect(p,NSMakeRect(15+pair.first%8*20,(self.shopMode?50:36)+pair.first/8*20,item.width*20,item.height*20))){self.buying=YES;self.buyHandler(pair.first);return;}}}[self mouseMoved:event];}
- (void)rightMouseDown:(NSEvent*)event{}
- (void)keyDown:(NSEvent*)event{if(event.keyCode==53&&self.closeHandler){self.closeHandler();return;}[self mouseMoved:event];}
